     Function eellff__ggeettsshhssttrrnnddxx() is deprecated.  Please use
     elf_getshdrstrndx(3) instead.

     Function eellff__ggeettsshhssttrrnnddxx() retrieves the section index of the string ta‐
     ble containing section names from descriptor _e_l_f and stores it into the
     location pointed to by argument _n_d_x_p_t_r.

     Function eellff__sseettsshhssttrrnnddxx() sets the index of the section name string ta‐
     ble to argument _n_d_x.

     These routines allow applications to process both normal ELF objects and
     ELF objects that use extended section numbering uniformly.

